\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Must every Boolean threshold of a real multilinear degree-at-most-d polynomial on the uniform n-cube, with $sign(0)=1$ and $1\leq d\leq n$, have total influence at most $8d\surd n$?

